# WN22-AC-000040: Windows Server 2022 password history must be configured to 24 passwords remembered.
# Source: Windows Server 2022 STIG r8
# Severity: medium
# Generated from 01-extract/output/windows-server-2022-stig-r8-controls.json

META
    esp_id `win2022-wn22-ac-000040-001`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `windows`
    criticality `high`

    title `Windows Server 2022 password history must be configured to 24 passwords remembered.`
    description `A system is more vulnerable to unauthorized access when system users recycle the same password several times without being required to change to a unique password on a regularly scheduled basis. This enables users to effectively negate the purpose of mandating periodic password changes. The default value is "24" for Windows domain systems. DOD has decided this is the appropriate value for all Windows systems.`
    author `scanset-security`
    tags `windows,server-2022,stig,medium,account-policy,security-policy`

    control_mapping `NIST-800-53:IA-5(1)(B)`
    control_objective `WN22-AC-000040`

    assessment_method `TEST`
    implementation_status `implemented`
    responsible_role `system-admin`

    control_origination `sp-system`
    inherited_from `Windows:server-2022:endpoint`
    customer_responsibility `configuration`

    remediation_days `30`
    recommendation `Configure the policy value for Computer Configuration >> Windows Settings >> Security Settings >> Account Policies >> Password Policy >> Enforce password history to "24" passwords remembered.`

    component_id `comp-windows-security-policy`

    impl_IA_5_1_B `Windows Server implements IA-5(1)(B) by enforcing PasswordHistorySize per the STIG (Password history must remember at least 24 passwords.). The ESP scanner queries the policy via the windows_security_policy CTN and fails the policy if the value does not match the STIG-required state. Remediation sets the policy via secedit or Group Policy.`

META_END

DEF
    OBJECT target
        policy_name `PasswordHistorySize`
    OBJECT_END

    STATE compliant
        exists boolean = true
        value_int int >= 24
    STATE_END

    CRI AND
        CTN windows_security_policy
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF compliant
            OBJECT_REF target
        CTN_END
    CRI_END
DEF_END
